  biomeName: The Tectonic Chute
  minDepthMeters: 0
  maxDepthMeters: 300
  shortDescription: A narrow straight canyon cut into granite, funneling the first
    cold currents.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Early exploration biome. Come here to learn routes, gather basics,
    and read walls, fissures, and major vertical routes.
  commonRewardHook: Common runs pay out in Copper Ore and Cobalt Alloy.
  rareRewardHook: 'Rare pull is modest: Iron Composite and Copper Wire.'
  landmarkIdentity: The Tectonic Chute reads through walls, fins, fissures, and giant
    vertical breaks. Landmarks should feel bright and readable.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are frequent. The player should often see a clear
    reset point nearby.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: vertical trap geometry and hard commitment. Creature
    pressure stays medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Targeted node work along long rock lines and exposed shelves.
    Early tier: keep runs short and work edges, cracks, and vertical seams.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is main ridge line. This slot should read through
    spine tooth, fin, or slab seam; use walls and breaks to mark route commitment.
